### get all customers
GET http://localhost:8080/customers?status=active
Content-Type: application/json

### get customer by id
GET http://localhost:8080/customers/2000
Content-Type: application/json

### create new account
POST http://localhost:8080/customers/2000/account
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "account_type": "saving",
    "amount": 5000
}

### make transaction
POST http://localhost:8080/customers/2000/accounts/95470
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "amount": 100,
    "transaction_type": "withdrawal"
}
